  "notes": "Using AMENDED HEFSP (March 4, 2026) per user instructions — FSHC challenged original June 24, 2025 HEFSP on September 2, 2025; FSHC settlement reached December 15, 2025; court order February 4, 2026; amended plan adopted March 4, 2026. Original HEFSP had obligation of 188 (DCA said 202; Borough adopted 188 per own calculation). RDP = 12 units from 2 components: Allegro Assisted Living (9 Medicaid beds) and Accessory Apartment Program (3 family rental units). Unmet need = 188 - 12 = 176 units. Borough must address minimum 25% of unmet need = 44 units through 10 inclusionary overlay zones (Table 2). Potential future BCUW group home at Borough-owned Block 707 Lots 1 & 16, Block 728 Lot 1 (0.508 acres) not yet committed — BCUW had 60 days from January 5, 2026 for due diligence. Candidate snapshot had HEFSP URL pointing to original 2025 plan (corrected to amended 2026 plan); snapshot blocks/lots for overlays confirmed accurate (Block 1316, Block 1406, Block 1204, Block 1205 etc.) but some lots differ from HEFSP table.",
